{"words": [{"text": "وَلَقَدْ", "translation": "And indeed"}, {"text": "ءَاتَيْنَا", "translation": "We gave"}, {"text": "مُوسَى", "translation": "Musa"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "وَقَفَّيْنَا", "translation": "and We followed up"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِهِۦ", "translation": "after him"}, {"text": "بِٱلرُّسُلِ ۖ", "translation": "with [the] Messengers"}, {"text": "وَءَاتَيْنَا", "translation": "And We gave"}, {"text": "عِيسَى", "translation": "Isa"}, {"text": "ٱبْنَ", "translation": "(the) son"}, {"text": "مَرْيَمَ", "translation": "(of) Maryam"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ", "translation": "[the] clear signs"}, {"text": "وَأَيَّدْنَـٰهُ", "translation": "and We supported him"}, {"text": "بِرُوحِ", "translation": "(with)"}, {"text": "ٱلْقُدُسِ ۗ", "translation": "the Holy Spirit"}, {"text": "أَفَكُلَّمَا", "translation": "Is it (not) so (that) whenever"}, {"text": "جَآءَكُمْ", "translation": "came to you"}, {"text": "رَسُولٌۢ", "translation": "a Messenger"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "with what"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(does) not"}, {"text": "تَهْوَىٰٓ", "translation": "desire"}, {"text": "أَنفُسُكُمُ", "translation": "yourselves"}, {"text": "ٱسْتَكْبَرْتُمْ", "translation": "you acted arrogantly"}, {"text": "فَفَرِيقًۭا", "translation": "So a party"}, {"text": "كَذَّبْتُمْ", "translation": "you denied"}, {"text": "وَفَرِيقًۭا", "translation": "and a party"}, {"text": "تَقْتُلُونَ", "translation": "you kill(ed)"}], "sahih": "And We did certainly give Moses the Scripture [i.e., the Torah] and followed up after him with messengers. And We gave Jesus, the son of Mary, clear proofs and supported him with the Pure Spirit [i.e., the angel Gabriel]. But is it [not] that every time a messenger came to you, [O Children of Israel], with what your souls did not desire, you were arrogant? And a party [of messengers] you denied and another party you killed."}